out.push("\n\n先来看最基础的 Basic Carousel。\n\n```html\n<section\n  aria-label=\"Featured collections\"\n  aria-roledescription=\"carousel\"\n>\n  <button type=\"button\" data-autoplay>\n    Stop slide rotation\n  </button>\n\n  <button type=\"button\" data-prev>\n    Previous slide\n  </button>\n\n  <button type=\"button\" data-next>\n    Next slide\n  </button>\n\n  <div class=\"carousel-slides\" aria-live=\"off\">\n\n    <div\n      role=\"group\"\n      aria-roledescription=\"slide\"\n      aria-label=\"1 of 3\"\n    >\n      <h2>Summer collection</h2>\n      <a href=\"/collections/summer\">Shop now</a>\n    </div>\n\n    <div\n      role=\"group\"\n      aria-roledescription=\"slide\"\n      aria-label=\"2 of 3\"\n      hidden\n    >\n      <h2>New arrivals</h2>\n      <a href=\"/collections/new\">Shop now</a>\n    </div>\n\n    <div\n      role=\"group\"\n      aria-roledescription=\"slide\"\n      aria-label=\"3 of 3\"\n      hidden\n    >\n      <h2>Winter sale</h2>\n      <a href=\"/collections/sale\">Shop now</a>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n```\n\n简化后的 Accessibility Tree：\n\n");
