out.push("\n\n| 状态 | 推荐通知策略 |\n|---|---|\n| 自动播放 | 不主动播报每张 Slide |\n| 用户手动切换 | 通知当前 Slide |\n| 用户暂停播放 | 可以通知后续手动切换 |\n| 用户访问 Slide 内容 | 通过正常阅读获取内容 |\n\n实际开发有两种实现方式。\n\n**方案一：动态调整内容区域的 aria-live。**\n\n```javascript\nfunction play() {\n  slideWrapper.setAttribute('aria-live', 'off');\n\n  startTimer();\n}\n\nfunction pause() {\n  stopTimer();\n\n  slideWrapper.setAttribute('aria-live', 'polite');\n}\n```\n\n**方案二：使用独立的状态通知区域。**\n\n```html\n<p role=\"status\" class=\"visually-hidden\"\n   data-carousel-status></p>\n```\n\n用户手动切换时：\n\n```javascript\nstatus.textContent =\n  'Slide 2 of 3: New arrivals.';\n```\n\n第二种方案通常更容易控制播报内容，尤其是 Slide 内部包含大量文字、价格和商品链接时。\n\n两种方案应避免同时播报相同信息。\n\n---\n\n## 9. 实战：封装 Accessible Carousel Web Component\n\n现在实现一个可以集成到 Shopify Theme 中的基础轮播组件。\n\n本次采用以下技术方案：单张 Slide 显示、原生 button、hidden 隔离、首尾循环、可选自动播放、独立 Live Region，以及减少运动偏好支持。\n\n### 9.1 HTML\n\n```html\n<accessible-carousel\n  role=\"region\"\n  aria-roledescription=\"carousel\"\n  aria-label=\"Featured collections\"\n  interval=\"5000\"\n>\n\n  <div class=\"carousel-controls\" data-controls hidden>\n\n    <button type=\"button\" data-play>\n      Start slide rotation\n    </button>\n\n    <button type=\"button\" data-pause>\n      Stop slide rotation\n    </button>\n\n    <button type=\"button\" data-prev>\n      Previous slide\n    </button>\n\n    <span data-counter aria-hidden=\"true\">1 / 3</span>\n\n    <button type=\"button\" data-next>\n      Next slide\n    </button>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"carousel-slides\">\n\n    <div\n      data-slide\n      data-title=\"Summer collection\"\n      role=\"group\"\n      aria-roledescription=\"slide\"\n      aria-label=\"1 of 3\"\n    >\n      <h2>Summer collection</h2>\n      <a href=\"/collections/summer\">Shop summer collection</a>\n    </div>\n\n    <div\n      data-slide\n      data-title=\"New arrivals\"\n      role=\"group\"\n      aria-roledescription=\"slide\"\n      aria-label=\"2 of 3\"\n    >\n      <h2>New arrivals</h2>\n      <a href=\"/collections/new\">Shop new arrivals</a>\n    </div>\n\n    <div\n      data-slide\n      data-title=\"Winter sale\"\n      role=\"group\"\n      aria-roledescription=\"slide\"\n      aria-label=\"3 of 3\"\n    >\n      <h2>Winter sale</h2>\n      <a href=\"/collections/sale\">Shop winter sale</a>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <p\n    data-status\n    role=\"status\"\n    class=\"visually-hidden\"\n  ></p>\n\n</accessible-carousel>\n```\n\n这里初始没有隐藏任何 Slide，而是先隐藏控制按钮。\n\n这样即使 JavaScript 加载失败，用户仍然可以阅读全部内容，而不会只看到第一张 Banner。\n\n组件默认手动播放。如果业务确实要求自动播放，可以添加 `autoplay` 属性。\n\n### 9.2 JavaScript\n\n创建 `assets/accessible-carousel.js`：\n\n```javascript\nclass AccessibleCarousel extends HTMLElement {\n  connectedCallback() {\n    if (this.controller) return;\n\n    this.slides = [...this.querySelectorAll('[data-slide]')];\n\n    if (!this.slides.length) return;\n\n    this.controls = this.querySelector('[data-controls]');\n    this.prevButton = this.querySelector('[data-prev]');\n    this.nextButton = this.querySelector('[data-next]');\n    this.playButton = this.querySelector('[data-play]');\n    this.pauseButton = this.querySelector('[data-pause]');\n    this.counter = this.querySelector('[data-counter]');\n    this.status = this.querySelector('[data-status]');\n\n    this.controller = new AbortController();\n\n    const signal = this.controller.signal;\n\n    this.index = 0;\n    this.timer = null;\n\n    const interval = Number(this.getAttribute('interval'));\n\n    this.interval = Number.isFinite(interval)\n      && interval >= 1000\n        ? interval\n        : 5000;\n\n    this.motion = matchMedia(\n      '(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)'\n    );\n\n    this.prevButton.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      this.pause();\n      this.show(this.index - 1, true);\n    }, { signal });\n\n    this.nextButton.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      this.pause();\n      this.show(this.index + 1, true);\n    }, { signal });\n\n    this.playButton.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      this.play();\n    }, { signal });\n\n    this.pauseButton.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      this.pause();\n    }, { signal });\n\n    // 焦点进入时停止自动播放\n    this.addEventListener('focusin', () => {\n      this.pause();\n    }, { signal });\n\n    // 用户开始查看轮播时停止播放\n    this.addEventListener('pointerenter', event => {\n      if (event.pointerType !== 'touch') {\n        this.pause();\n      }\n    }, { signal });\n\n    // 页面不可见时停止播放\n    document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', () => {\n      if (document.hidden) {\n        this.pause();\n      }\n    }, { signal });\n\n    // 系统开启减少运动偏好时停止播放\n    this.motion.addEventListener('change', event => {\n      if (event.matches) {\n        this.pause();\n      }\n    }, { signal });\n\n    this.controls.hidden = this.slides.length < 2;\n\n    this.show(0);\n    this.pause();\n\n    if (\n      this.hasAttribute('autoplay') &&\n      !this.motion.matches &&\n      !document.hidden &&\n      !this.matches(':hover') &&\n      !this.contains(document.activeElement)\n    ) {\n      this.play();\n    }\n  }\n\n  show(index, announce = false) {\n    const length = this.slides.length;\n\n    const nextIndex = (index % length + length) % length;\n\n    const oldSlide = this.slides[this.index];\n\n    // 避免将当前焦点直接隐藏\n    if (\n      nextIndex !== this.index &&\n      oldSlide?.contains(document.activeElement)\n    ) {\n      if (this.controls.hidden) return;\n\n      this.nextButton.focus();\n    }\n\n    this.index = nextIndex;\n\n    this.slides.forEach((slide, i) => {\n      slide.hidden = i !== this.index;\n    });\n\n    this.counter.textContent =\n      `${this.index + 1} / ${length}`;\n\n    if (announce) {\n      const title =\n        this.slides[this.index].dataset.title || '';\n\n      this.status.textContent =\n        `Slide ${this.index + 1} of ${length}: ${title}`;\n    }\n  }\n\n  play() {\n    if (\n      this.timer !== null ||\n      this.slides.length < 2 ||\n      document.hidden ||\n      this.slides[this.index].contains(document.activeElement)\n    ) return;\n\n    this.timer = setInterval(() => {\n      this.show(this.index + 1);\n    }, this.interval);\n\n    this.updatePlaybackControls();\n  }\n\n  pause() {\n    clearInterval(this.timer);\n\n    this.timer = null;\n\n    this.updatePlaybackControls();\n  }\n\n  updatePlaybackControls() {\n    const playing = this.timer !== null;\n\n    this.playButton.setAttribute(\n      'aria-disabled',\n      String(playing)\n    );\n\n    this.pauseButton.setAttribute(\n      'aria-disabled',\n      String(!playing)\n    );\n  }\n\n  disconnectedCallback() {\n    this.pause();\n\n    this.controller?.abort();\n    this.controller = null;\n  }\n}\n\nif (!customElements.get('accessible-carousel')) {\n  customElements.define(\n    'accessible-carousel',\n    AccessibleCarousel\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 9.3 为什么这里采用两个播放控制按钮？\n\n常见 Carousel 使用一个动态切换的 Play / Pause 按钮即可。\n\n本示例选择了两个固定名称的按钮，是为了简化焦点进入导致播放暂停、用户主动启动播放以及按钮名称同步之间的关系。\n\n同时采用了更保守的播放策略：Hover、Focus 或页面隐藏导致暂停后，不自动恢复，必须由用户主动启动。\n\n用户在减少运动模式下仍然可以明确选择启动播放；本示例没有额外的位移动画，也不会默认自动播放。\n\n### 9.4 CSS\n\n```css\naccessible-carousel {\n  display: block;\n}\n\naccessible-carousel [hidden] {\n  display: none !important;\n}\n\n.carousel-controls {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.carousel-controls button {\n  min-width: 44px;\n  min-height: 44px;\n  padding: 8px 12px;\n}\n\n.carousel-controls [aria-disabled=\"true\"] {\n  opacity: 0.6;\n  cursor: default;\n}\n\naccessible-carousel :focus-visible {\n  outline: 2px solid currentColor;\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  accessible-carousel [data-slide] {\n    animation: none;\n    transition: none;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 9.5 交互状态演示\n\n");
